<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to May 8 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to May 8 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $781.88 billion in the week to May 8 from $833.56 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     36.60		51.11</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     20.64		31.46</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  745.28	     782.44</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    216.70	     199.40</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	559.90	     613.75</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    221.97	     219.81</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
